lects zero/affine/nonlinear controls using three inner-fold risks and already uses offset-invariant outer studentization. Historical aggregate combined_score=0.4775356503963919, correct=true, empirical_coverage=0.9671428571428571, mean_width_ratio=1.035544888138825, minimum_case_coverage=0.94, failure_fraction=0.0. Selection frequencies and causal score explanations are unknown; prior overall rubric-failure cause remains unknown. Considered richer splines alone, smaller critical values or altered fallbacks, and full-sample calibration; chose a bounded training-only smooth covariance-stack patch preserving inference machinery. No task program, evaluator, benchmark, optimizer, simulation, test, installation, or research subprocess was run; no forbidden literature accessed. Matching JSON outputs written; every implementation rubric has specific executable source_contains patterns. Only canonical ideas/03_smooth_covariance_stacking_of_frozen_score_controls/memory.md used locally; campaign memory and conclusions updated directly.\n- unknown_ts | step=unknown_step | scope=unknown_scope\n  - summary: (missing summary)\n  - evidence: (missing evidence)\n- unknown_ts | step=unknown_step | scope=unknown_scope\n  - summary: (missing summary)\n  - evidence: (missing evidence)\n- 2026-11-17T18:59:29.891248+00:00 | step=evaluate | scope=attempt\n  - summary: harness evaluated program_1 exactly once\n  - evidence: combined_score=0.4634577580619882, correct=True; scientific acceptance passed; search metrics (data): {\"combined_score\": 0.4634577580619882, \"control_pass\": 1, \"correct\": true, \"empirical_coverage\": 0.97, \"failure_fraction\": 0.0, \"mean_width_ratio\": 1.0346987884024752, \"minimum_case_coverage\": 0.93, \"nominal_coverage\": 0.95, \"scientific_validity\": 0, \"width_utility\": 0.49202918663341666}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
