opic-level citation of Some New Perspectives on the Method of Control Variates (2002); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Glynn'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W1499749778']\n64 Restricted topic-level citation of The Elements of Statistical Learning (2009); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Hastie'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W2787894218']\n65 Restricted topic-level citation of Ridge Regression: Biased Estimation for Nonorthogonal Problems (1970); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Hoerl'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W4234698323']\n66 Restricted topic-level citation of Cross-Validatory Choice and Assessment of Statistical Predictions (1974); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Stone'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W2112081648']\n67 Restricted topic-level citation of Stacked generalization (1992); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Wolpert'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W28412257']\n68 Restricted topic-level citation of Stacked Regressions (1996); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Breiman'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W2914369697']\n69 Restricted topic-level citation of Inference for the Generalization Error (2003); exact-work metadata and available abstract consulted, without following citation graphs. citations= ['Nadeau'] sources= ['ref.openalex.W2120199131']\n\nFinal evaluation keys: ['correct', 'evaluation_evidence', 'evaluator_sha256', 'manifest_path', 'metrics', 'outcome', 'program_tree_sha256', 'results_tree_sha256', 'status', 'task_tree_sha256']\nEvidence-source keys: ['ablations', 'investigation']\nGrounding-source keys: ['final.evidence.episodes', 'final.metric.combined_score', 'final.metric.control_pass', 'final.metric.correct', 'final.metric.empirical_coverage', 'final.metric.failure_fraction', 'final.metric.mean_width_ratio', 'final.metric.minimum_case_coverage', 'final.metric.nominal_coverage', 'final.metric.scientific_validity', 'final.metric.width_utility', 'final.qualification.correct', 'final.qualification.outcome', 'final.qualification.status', 'result.best_any_score', 'result.best_correct_score', 'result.improvement_001', 'result.improvement_002', 'result.top_program_01', 'result.top_program_02', 'result.top_program_03', 'result.total_attempts', 'result.total_correct_programs', 'result.total_evaluated_programs', 'result.total_ideas']\nAblation studies: []\n\nStrategy thesis: The frozen risk-adaptive control method yields narrower mean intervals than PPI and PPI++ on the evaluated empirical gene-expression source, but is wider than PPI++ in all six synthetic or perturbed-score conditions; observed coverage and offset-invariant studentization support a conditional efficiency study, not universal narrowing or a finite-sample validity certificate.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
